### **Refined `.gitignore` for Navigation Domain POC**

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
venv/
.venv/

# Data & Databases (The Mart)
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
data/processed/
mart/*/segments/*.parquet

# Raw Mission Logs (optional, if too large for Git)
data/raw/*/*.log
data/raw/*/*.bin

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
```
# Ignore raw flight data
src/ingress/bin/*.bin
src/ingress/bin/*.jsonl
src/ingress/*.bin
src/ingress/*.jsonl

# Ignore python cache
__pycache__/